              is the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/product"} product
              of the profinite completion
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mover
                      %mi ℤ
                      %mo ^
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \widehat{\mathbb{Z}}
              of the integers, example
              = succeed "," do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ProfCompletionOfIntegers"}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/real+numbers"} real numbers
            .maruku-equation
