          %h3#AsFormalNeighbourhoodOfPrime As the formal neighbourhood of a prime
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/formal+spectrum"} formal spectrum
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
